id: MOD14-1
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: round_persist
target: crates/core/src/history_boot.rs
find:         Session::from_state(ir, state),
replace:         Session::from_state(ir, { let mut st = state; st.run.slices.retain(|r, _| !r.0.ends_with("@round1")); st }),
expect-fail: mod14_two_rounds_history_keeps_four_slices_across_reload
note: 再読み込みで 1 周目の根の切り身を落とす
